# Super+arrow tiling, shipped with bvwm.
# State 3 marks a tiled (percentage) maximize so Super+Up can still fill
# the working area instead of toggling the tile off.
# bhotkeys-bvwm advertises these chords. bvwm owns the keys.
# Live reload: FvwmCommand 'Read $[FVWM_DATADIR]/default-config/tiling'
#
# Key functions mark the Super chord before they return (PipeRead, so
# the flag exists before Super release). The listener does not see
# these keys: the plugins are listen 0.
# FvwmEventTile is a second FvwmEvent. KillModule FvwmEvent with no
# alias kills every FvwmEvent, including this one. Kill the desk
# module by its own alias.
#
# Super+T is per monitor + desk + pager page (Ctrl+arrows / Ctrl+1-9).
# One cell can be tiled while the next stays floating; a new map on a
# floating cell must not Move the tiled cell's windows onto this page.
#
# Maximize percentages are of the window's monitor working area (taskbar
# strut on the laptop panel only). Move without "screen" is percent of the
# *global* desktop, so 0 0 / 50 0 yanked eDP-1 tiles onto DP-4. Always pass
# screen $[w.screen]. Maximize flags (screen ...) must precede True or the
# 50 100 sizes are dropped and it becomes 100 100 (same as Super+Up).
# Super+Up is 100 100 (not grow) so FvwmPager is covered.
# fvwm-tile places in working-area pixels (primary + $[taskbar_h]) so
# Maximize's working-area percents and Move's screen percents do not
# leave a gutter between tiles. Style all windows, UpdateStyles once,
# then geometry; otherwise the first tile is sized with the title bar
# still on and leaves a taskbar gap after NoTitle.
# Move screen MON is the current page of that output. Page stride is
# $[vp.width] x $[vp.height] (bounding box), not the output size, so a
# narrower output's gap is not treated as the next pager cell. Pass
# output origin + vp size; fvwm-tile uses v-prefix virtual coords.

DestroyFunc SuperChord
AddToFunc   SuperChord
+ I PipeRead `bvwm-super-menu-handler chord; echo Nop`

DestroyFunc TileApply
AddToFunc   TileApply
+ I SuperChord
+ I ThisWindow (Transient) Break
+ I ThisWindow (CirculateSkip) Break
+ I ThisWindow (!Maximizable) Break
+ I ThisWindow (WindowListSkip) Break
+ I ThisWindow ("florence") Break
+ I ThisWindow ("Florence") Break
+ I ThisWindow ("FvwmPager") Break
+ I ThisWindow ("FvwmButtons") Break
+ I ThisWindow ("Conky") Break
+ I ThisWindow ("Conky*") Break
+ I ThisWindow (Shaded) WindowShade False
+ I ThisWindow (Iconic) Iconify off
+ I PipeRead `fvwm-tile snap $[w.id] $[w.screen] $[w.desk] $[w.pagex] $[w.pagey] $[monitor.$[w.screen].width] $[monitor.$[w.screen].height] $0 $1 $2 $3 $[monitor.primary] $[taskbar_h] $[monitor.$[w.screen].x] $[monitor.$[w.screen].y] $[vp.width] $[vp.height]`

DestroyFunc TileMaximize
AddToFunc   TileMaximize
+ I SuperChord
+ I ThisWindow (Transient) Break
+ I ThisWindow (CirculateSkip) Break
+ I ThisWindow (!Maximizable) Break
+ I ThisWindow (WindowListSkip) Break
+ I ThisWindow (Shaded) WindowShade False
+ I ThisWindow (Iconic) Iconify off
+ I ThisWindow (Maximized, !State 3) Maximize False
+ I TestRc (Match) Break
+ I State 3 False
+ I PipeRead `fvwm-tile snap $[w.id] $[w.screen] $[w.desk] $[w.pagex] $[w.pagey] $[monitor.$[w.screen].width] $[monitor.$[w.screen].height] 100 100 0 0 $[monitor.primary] $[taskbar_h] $[monitor.$[w.screen].x] $[monitor.$[w.screen].y] $[vp.width] $[vp.height]`

# Super+Ctrl+Up inserts into a per-cell layout (1 full, 2 split, 3
# split the second pane, 4 quads, 5+ balanced grid). Super+T off: a
# second press rotates (swap if occupied); Super+Ctrl+Down walks back;
# Super+arrows snap only that window. Super+T on: dense tiling WM;
# new maps join, close compacts, Super+Ctrl+Down ejects, Super+arrows
# pin that window and reflow the rest. Harvest skips Florence, Conky,
# FvwmPager, and the FvwmButtons taskbar. Super+Down ejects immediately.

DestroyFunc TileInsert
AddToFunc   TileInsert
+ I SuperChord
+ I ThisWindow (Transient) Break
+ I ThisWindow (CirculateSkip) Break
+ I ThisWindow (!Maximizable) Break
+ I ThisWindow (State 1) Break
+ I ThisWindow (State 2) Break
+ I ThisWindow ("florence") Break
+ I ThisWindow ("Florence") Break
+ I ThisWindow ("florence-sticky") Break
+ I ThisWindow ("Florence-sticky") Break
+ I ThisWindow ("FvwmPager") Break
+ I ThisWindow ("FvwmButtons") Break
+ I ThisWindow ("Conky") Break
+ I ThisWindow ("Conky*") Break
+ I ThisWindow (WindowListSkip) Break
+ I ThisWindow (Shaded) WindowShade False
+ I ThisWindow (Iconic) Iconify off
+ I PipeRead `fvwm-tile insert $[w.id] $[w.screen] $[w.desk] $[w.pagex] $[w.pagey] $[monitor.$[w.screen].width] $[monitor.$[w.screen].height] $[monitor.primary] $[taskbar_h] $[monitor.$[w.screen].x] $[monitor.$[w.screen].y] $[vp.width] $[vp.height]`

