+ I PipeRead `fvwm-tile harvest-add $[w.id] $[w.screen] $[w.desk] $[w.pagex] $[w.pagey] $[monitor.$[w.screen].width] $[monitor.$[w.screen].height] $[monitor.primary] $[taskbar_h] $[monitor.$[w.screen].x] $[monitor.$[w.screen].y] $[vp.width] $[vp.height]`

