DestroyFunc TileAutoToggle
AddToFunc   TileAutoToggle
+ I SuperChord
+ I PipeRead `fvwm-tile auto-toggle $[monitor.current] $[monitor.$[monitor.current].desk] $[monitor.$[monitor.current].pagex] $[monitor.$[monitor.current].pagey] $[monitor.$[monitor.current].width] $[monitor.$[monitor.current].height] $[monitor.primary] $[taskbar_h] $[monitor.$[monitor.current].x] $[monitor.$[monitor.current].y] $[vp.width] $[vp.height]`

